<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westfield Trust sees higher profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westfield Trust sees higher profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shopping centre operator Westfield Trust said on Thursday it expected to report a higher profit in 1997 compared with 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect it to be up,&quot; Westfield Trust executive director Steven Lowy told Reuters after a news conference.  </p>
<p>Lowy said the did not at this stage plan any major acquisitions during the current year.</p>
<p>Westfield Trust earlier reported an 18.7 percent rise in net profit for calendar 1996 to A$222.7 million, boosted mainly by acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
